From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SWEEP-Bench <sweep-bench@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Ground-truth belt speed as one more proprio channel

data.train.speed_list (per-episode belt speeds) appends the encoded speed
(v - 0.25) / 0.15 to every proprio row. model.speed_conditioned adds a
zero-initialized weight for it, so the first forward equals the plain
model's.
